1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:01,552
What is a JEPA?

2
00:00:02,492 --> 00:00:05,154
An encoder embeds two
views of the same data.

3
00:00:05,154 --> 00:00:07,869
A predictor maps one
embedding onto the other.

4
00:00:08,809 --> 00:00:12,961
It predicts embeddings, not
pixels, so it learns what matters.

5
00:00:13,901 --> 00:00:17,903
LeJEPA adds SIGReg, which keeps
the embeddings from collapsing.
